Modifications for dsh-bilibili-pro: long-transcript segmentation/paging/search,
picture-driven frame capture with scene alignment and sharpness refinement,
optional vision descriptions and citation hints, two-pass prompts, Bcut ASR
with an optional faster-whisper fallback, an HTML frame gallery, and multi-part
page selection. Danmaku, all-pages batch extraction, and the old environment
checker are not ported. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the full attribution
